# Execution model

Follow the sequence in `change-control-manifest.mdc` strictly.

Do not jump to step 7 (patch) until steps 1–6 are satisfied for the task type.

When an active skill **iron law** forbids app patches (e.g. `/builder-feature` plan-only), follow [`change-control-manifest.mdc`](../change-control-manifest.mdc) § Active skill precedence — skip steps 7–8 for application source.

For defects: use `/debug` instead of inventing a shorter process.
